---
description: Prepare one qualifyExhibition evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ExhibitionLabel[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Review the complete exhibition for narrative coherence, factual support, rights, conservation, accessibility, and operational feasibility. Compare alternative arrangements, resolve conflicts with qualified owners, and freeze the approved content and installation plan together. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
